flowchart TD
    Admin[Admin user] --> UI[Knowledge Base settings UI]
    UI --> SourcesAPI[Sources API]
    UI --> DocsAPI[Documents API]
    UI --> JobsAPI[Jobs API]

    SourcesAPI --> DB[(Tenant-scoped data store)]
    DocsAPI --> DB
    DocsAPI --> JobStore[Ingest job store]
    JobsAPI --> Runner[Ingest runner]
    JobStore --> Runner
    Runner --> Chunker[Text chunker]
    Runner --> Embedder[Embedding provider]
    Chunker --> DB
    Embedder --> DB

    User[Technician / planner / admin] --> AskAPI[Ask and search API]
    AskAPI --> Filters[Tenant + role filters]
    Filters --> Retrieval[Hybrid retrieval]
    Retrieval --> DB
    Retrieval --> Answer[Grounded answer package]
    Answer --> User
    AskAPI --> QueryLog[Metadata query log]
    QueryLog --> DB
